-- [transition=swing] [duration=2.679214]
Keybindings:

-- [transition=sheet] [duration=2.913154]
right, down or space - next slide

-- [transition=slide-left] [duration=4.702688]
left or up - previous slide

-- [transition=sheet] [duration=3.435221]
B - blanking of screen

-- [transition=slide-up] [duration=3.435221]
F11 - toggle fullscreen!

-- [transition=text-slide-down] [duration=2.167284]
Escape - quit pinpoint

-- [fill] [transition=slide-in-left] [command=printf 'Pinpoint command ran inside the sandbox\n'] [duration=16.965691]
Enter - Run the slide command

Commands run inside Pinpoint's sandbox.
They cannot launch host programs or read arbitrary host files.
#@alt: A demonstration slide explaining that presentation commands are deliberately confined to Pinpoint's sandbox.

